@startuml Update Competition

actor Organizer
participant Frontend
participant Backend
participant Database

Organizer -> Frontend: Update competition details
Frontend -> Backend: PUT /api/v1/competitions/{id}
Backend -> Database: Verify organizer ownership
alt Not owner
  Backend --> Frontend: 403 Forbidden
  Frontend --> Organizer: Show error
else
  Backend -> Database: Update competition
  Database --> Backend: Competition updated
  Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK
  Frontend --> Organizer: Show success
end
@enduml
